    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TUNE IN TO THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel Surfing is an idle game that sits directly on your desktop, disguised as an innocent retro television set. But this is no ordinary TV - each channel holds unique gameplay experiences waiting to be discovered. With connections to be made</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/7f0bad9729d849a34626452a6fdbc944.poster.avif?t=1751488624\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/7f0bad9729d849a34626452a6fdbc944.webm?t=1751488624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/7f0bad9729d849a34626452a6fdbc944.mp4?t=1751488624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S ON THE DIAL?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin fidget toys, pop bubbles, hunt for treasure, and many more activities across the various channels. Each offers different ways to earn resources, unlock upgrades, and progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/7971e317051d3097a57b219bf9e06ae0.poster.avif?t=1751488624\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/7971e317051d3097a57b219bf9e06ae0.webm?t=1751488624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/7971e317051d3097a57b219bf9e06ae0.mp4?t=1751488624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Channel Experience</strong>: Navigate through multiple distinct gameplay channels, each with its own mechanics, visuals, and progression systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Progression</strong>: Every channel continues to progress even when you're not actively playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Channel Interactions</strong>: Actions in one channel affect others in surprising ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Integration</strong>: Sits unobtrusively on your desktop while you work or play other games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Unlocks</strong>: Discover hidden  actions, and combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/56dcc1d80d7632482d418600863bd55b.poster.avif?t=1751488624\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/56dcc1d80d7632482d418600863bd55b.webm?t=1751488624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571530/extras/56dcc1d80d7632482d418600863bd55b.mp4?t=1751488624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
